WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:14.359
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:21.058
Say Kothrud has run out of Masala Chai Mix. First check what Camp, your current branch, holds.

3
00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:28.522
Open Stock Transfers. The list shows every transfer between your branches.

4
00:00:28.622 --> 00:00:30.935
Click Add Stock Transfer.

5
00:00:31.035 --> 00:00:37.170
From branch is Camp, the branch you are in. Choose Kothrud as the branch that receives the stock.

6
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.536
Notes are optional. They help whoever opens the transfer later.

7
00:00:41.636 --> 00:00:45.077
Click Add Item to add a product to the transfer.

8
00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:48.318
Choose the product to move.

9
00:00:48.418 --> 00:00:53.178
Enter how many to send. You cannot send more than the source branch has.

10
00:00:54.479 --> 00:01:00.124
Click Save. The stock moves straight away: there is nothing to confirm at the other end.

11
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:07.890
Each transfer gets a TRF code. Open it to see the branches, the products and the quantities.

12
00:01:10.191 --> 00:01:13.962
Now switch to Kothrud with the branch menu at the top.

13
00:01:14.863 --> 00:01:19.842
In Stock levels, the 15 units have arrived at Kothrud.

14
00:01:22.614 --> 00:01:28.749
A transfer cannot be undone. To fix a mistake, send the stock back with a transfer the other way.
